    "sentence_translations": [
      "Blind People",
      "",
      "The more people nowadays use cellphones, computers, and other electronics, the less they talk with other people face-to-face.",
      "This phenomenon can be seen in many countries.",
      "For example, on the Shanghai subway, basically everyone is using their cellphone.",
      "Recently Apple founder Steve Wozniak was interviewed.",
      "He was asked how he looks at this situation. His answer was very interesting.",
      "Wozniak said that he had talked with Steve Jobs about something when they were setting up Apple.",
      "They talked about how technology would, in the future, allow blind people to live like normal people.",
      "Wozniak said that looking at how people on the street nowadays look at their cellphones the entire time and don’t look at anything else ..",
      ".. made him feel like they had succeeded.",
      "Sighted people, just like blind people, don’t see anything now."
    ]
